{"id":"618ad68d5b8ce43d","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-composition-map.md","title":"ZFC Composition Map","display":"df-zfc-composition-map — ZFC Composition Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-composition-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-composition-map","58-df-zfc-map-composition-map"],"display":"df-zfc-composition-map — ZFC Composition Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-composition-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-composition-map</span><span>58-df-zfc-map-composition-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-composition-map — ZFC Composition Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"58-df-relation\">58-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g \\in V\">\\(f,g \\in V\\)</span> (binary relations or function graphs to be composed)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h \\in V\">\\(h \\in V\\)</span> (composition graph defined by the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z \\in V\">\\(x,y,z \\in V\\)</span> (tuple coordinates bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S\\)</span> (typed relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"58-df-relation\">58-df-relation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompositionMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompositionMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMapCompositionMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMapCompositionMap}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}composition\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompositionMap}_S(h,g,f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A,B,C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Rel}_S(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_S(g,B,C)\\land h=\\{\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in A\\times C:\\exists y\\in B\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in g)\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}composition\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompositionMap}_S(h,g,f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A,B,C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Rel}_S(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_S(g,B,C)\\land h=\\{\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in A\\times C:\\exists y\\in B\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in g)\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}composition\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapCompositionMap}_S(h,g,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CompositionMap}_S(h,g,f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}composition\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapCompositionMap}_S(h,g,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CompositionMap}_S(h,g,f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is typed relational composition through an explicit middle carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>; when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> are compatible function graphs, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> is the graph of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\circ f\">\\(g\\circ f\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-map-composition-map</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rel}_S$ (typed relation predicate, see [[58-df-relation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,g \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"h \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompositionMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMapCompositionMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}composition\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompositionMap}_S(h,g,f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A,B,C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Rel}_S(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_S(g,B,C)\\land h=\\{\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in A\\times C:\\exists y\\in B\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in g)\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}composition\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapCompositionMap}_S(h,g,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CompositionMap}_S(h,g,f)","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"g\\circ f","display":false}],"bytes":1421,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1771","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-composition-map.md|58-df-zfc-composition-map]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","7ccfc8c88f29968a"]}